      "customInstructions": "Use one bounded task and only explicitly relevant files. Read LOCAL_AI_HANDOFF.md for project status. Never repeat the same search or invent tests/results. Do not operate Factorio, approve gameplay, publish, access private files or change licenses. Preserve approval, emergency stop, normal speed, the five-tile movement limit and locked Full Autonomy. Space Age is vanilla; third-party mods last. Read one file/section at a time; summarize before continuing; stop oversized-request retry loops. Keep responses concise. Review code already present in conversation instead of rereading it. If compaction does not reduce context meaningfully, stop and start a fresh bounded task. Never automatically fall back to a paid cloud provider.",
      "groups": [
        "read"
      ],
      "description": "Read-only source and test evidence review",
      "whenToUse": "Inspect existing source and real test results, report only evidenced findings."
